EMD reference implementation attribution
======================================

The behavior adaptations in envelope/envelope.cpp, emd/decomposition.cpp,
emd/mask.cpp, emd/second_layer.cpp and transforms/hilbert.cpp
are based on the locally supplied emd 0.8.1 Python package, specifically
emd/_sift_core.py, emd/sift.py, emd/spectra.py and emd/imftools.py,
by Andrew Quinn and the emd contributors.

Upstream source: https://gitlab.com/emd-dev/emd
Upstream documentation: https://emd.readthedocs.io/

